      "props": {
        "text": "The entire MiroShark README was rebuilt from a text-heavy documentation page into an image-driven landing page. Shields.io badges replaced with 14 custom self-hosted SVG pill buttons in the purple/chrome brand style. 11 new brand images added — hero, 6 use-case cards, feature wall, and community tiles."
      }
